	(text "INTERCONNECT J30 - 26-way IDC ribbon to CONTROLLER BOARD J30 (pin 1 to pin 1)\nTo controller: +5V (1,2), +12V (18, rail monitor + 12V sensors), ESTOP_OK (19), HP_OK (20)\nFrom controller: RLY1-10, FAN_RLY, RLY11/12 (valves 9/10), SAFE_EN (12)\nGND: 3, 4, 11, 23, 24.  Pin 25 = HEATER_RLY (optional tank heater). Pin 26 spare."(exclude_from_sim no)(at 25.40 124.46 0)(effects(font(size 1.27 1.27))(justify left top))(uuid "da92846c-3aca-49ec-8b2f-2bfc1f1b28d5"))
